[Act 12 of 2024 wef 30/08/2024]
(1A) A foreign regulatory authority may, with the prior written approval of the Authority, appoint any person to conduct the inspection under subsection (1) and in such event, this section (other than this subsection) applies to the person as if a reference to the foreign regulatory authority or any official of the foreign regulatory authority in this section includes a reference to the person.
